# AF403 — Calibrated Blast's DigUntil reveal, against real Forge. Seat 0
# (human) holds Calibrated Blast ({2}{R}) and three Mountains; its library's
# known top three are two lands then a nonland (Lightning Bolt, CMC 1), so
# the dig reveals exactly Mountain, Mountain, Lightning Bolt and stops
# (`RevealedLibraryPosition$ -1`: the three go to the bottom). The reflexive
# trigger then deals 1 damage (Lightning Bolt's CMC) to any target; seat 1's
# lone Memnite is a legal, clickable target so the test need not drive a
# player-target select.
